06:42.270 --> 06:43.260
Đánh chết hắn!

06:43.290 --> 06:44.000
Nhanh lên!

06:44.780 --> 06:45.050
♪ Meo meo meo meo meo ♪

06:45.250 --> 06:46.300
♪ Meo meo meo meo meo ♪

06:46.360 --> 06:47.290
Đánh chết ngươi!

06:46.710 --> 06:47.110
♪ Meo meo meo meo meo ♪

06:47.290 --> 06:48.310
♪ Meo meo meo meo meo ♪

06:47.360 --> 06:48.650
